# This machine's own helper (written by `make helper-local`), which is the
# deployable artifact with the ssh client linked in (nocx_local_ssh).
#
# A directory of its own because the artifact name is frozen as
# nocx-helper-<goos>-<goarch>.gz and the platform is the whole of it: two
# variants of one platform cannot be told apart by the name.
#
# This committed .gitignore is also what makes the //go:embed all:bin/local in
# the parent package compile on a checkout that has never built the variant —
# a pattern matching no file is a compile error, and the all: prefix matches
# dotfiles, so it always matches at least this file.
nocx-helper-*.gz
